ralleled among her peers, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but she has ended more corrupted shrine maidens than demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her mind is tortured by having to kill her corrupted friends in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the battle against demons goes on....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf only I could become a heartless demon-slaying robot one day.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koharu thought to herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/ce217a3bc0ba3c2ee84771c41b7cac4d.webp?t=1750648209\" width=200 height=60 /></span>This is a side-scroller action game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters can switch between different fighting styles that have respective features,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your style tactically to counter various situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During missions, there are a variety of enemies and treasures,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >finish mission challenges and aim for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two playable characters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each has unique fighting styles and enhancements,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are also RPG elements such as equipment and equipment upgrades!</p>",
